       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "A warehouse fire broke out at the Kellet Point industrial estate in Osmery on 2 December 2025.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Within the first two hours a warning was issued for the neighbouring settlement of Brayle and later extended to Sunder Flats, and Kellet Road was closed through the estate and the Merrin Canal area.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "No casualties were reported in the opening phase of the incident.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The site operator Fallon Coatings deployed to the fire while authorities issued information on the road closure; no cause had been given.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
